 said Cleveland State head coach, Dennis Felton.\"}, {\"id\": \"s5\", \"text\": \"\\\"He brings a level of athleticism and skill that will undoubtedly make an immediate impact on our team.\"}, {\"id\": \"s6\", \"text\": \"We're excited to see him take the court and contribute to our success.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"Niakate, a 6'8\\\" forward, is known for his versatility and ability to score from both inside and outside the paint.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"He averaged 18 points and 7 rebounds per game in his senior season at high school, earning him All-State honors and attracting the attention of college scouts from across the country.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"\\\"Modibo is a tremendous addition to our program,\\\" said Cleveland State athletic director, Scott Garrett.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"\\\"He's a talented player who fits perfectly into our system and will help us compete at a high level in the Horizon League.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"We're looking forward to seeing him develop and grow as a player over the next few years.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"According to data from the NCAA, the Cleveland State Vikings men's basketball team has struggled in recent years, finishing with a sub-.500 record in three of the last four seasons.\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"However, with the addition of Niakate and other talented recruits, the team is poised to make a significant turnaround in the upcoming season.\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"\\\"Modibo's commitment is a huge step forward for our program,\\\" said Felton.\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"\\\"We're building a team that will compete for championships and make our fans proud.\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"We're excited to get started and see what the future holds.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s17\", \"text\": \"With Niakate on board, the Cleveland State Vikings men's basketball team is gearing up for a season that promises to be filled with excitement and promise.\"}, {\"id\": \"s18\", \"text\": \"Stay tuned for more updates on this developing story.\"}]}"
